{"id":"767001834b33a487","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ce-degree-splitting.md","title":"非零 c.e. 度的严格下度分裂","display":"thm-ce-degree-splitting — 非零 c.e. 度的严格下度分裂","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ce-degree-splitting","aliases":["20-thm-ce-degree-splitting"],"display":"thm-ce-degree-splitting — 非零 c.e. 度的严格下度分裂","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"corrected-counterexample","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.3；原错误断言的反证","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ce-degree-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ce-degree-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-degree-splitting — 非零 c.e. 度的严格下度分裂"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"corrected-counterexample"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.3；原错误断言的反证"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db3ed557a2183bff\" href=\"?note=db3ed557a2183bff\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees\">20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span> 为零度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee\">\\(\\vee\\)</span> 为 Turing 度的最小上界运算。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db3ed557a2183bff\" href=\"?note=db3ed557a2183bff\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees\">20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[(\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ [\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a_i\\land\\mathbf a_i&lt;\\mathbf b])\\land\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1=\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[(\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ [\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a_i\\land\\mathbf a_i&lt;\\mathbf b])\\land\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1=\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Sacks 的不可比分裂直接给出所示两个非零严格下度。旧文件名将这个分裂推论误称为 Lachlan non-splitting；修订名称只反映这里实际陈述的结果，不另行引入其他区间上的 non-splitting 定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.3；原错误断言的反证；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"db3ed557a2183bff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"db3ed557a2183bff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[(\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ [\\mathbf0<\\mathbf a_i\\land\\mathbf a_i<\\mathbf b])\\land\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1=\\mathbf b].","display":true}],"bytes":1653,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["db3ed557a2183bff","f389bdba28de0478"]}